%% title: Analytics Ingestion Flow — Kafka → analytics-sink → ClickHouse warehouse
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PS as Producing Service<br/>(account/transaction/balance/<br/>party/kyc/consent)
    participant OB as Transactional Outbox<br/>(ADR-0003)
    participant KF as Kafka<br/>analytics-events-in
    participant AC as AnalyticsConsumer<br/>(@Incoming)
    participant PM as PayloadMasker<br/>(PII boundary)
    participant SG as SchemaGovernance<br/>(catalogue check)
    participant AS as AnalyticsSink<br/>(port/out)
    participant CH as ClickHouse<br/>openbank_analytics
    participant DL as DeadLetterSink<br/>(quarantine)
    participant WA as WormArchive<br/>(S3 Object Lock)

    PS->>OB: write domain event (transactional)
    OB->>KF: relay event (at-least-once)
    KF->>AC: consume raw JSON (consumer group: analytics-sink)
    AC->>AC: map to AnalyticsEnvelope<br/>(infer aggregateType/aggregateId/version)
    AC->>PM: mask PII leaves<br/>(email, IBAN, PAN, phone, name, national-id)
    PM-->>AC: masked AnalyticsEnvelope

    alt schema accepted
        AC->>SG: check eventType:schemaVersion
        SG-->>AC: OK
        AC->>AS: write envelope
        AS->>CH: INSERT bronze_events<br/>(ReplacingMergeTree dedupes by event_id)
        CH-->>AS: ack
        AS->>AS: compute record_hash (SHA-256)
        AS->>AS: accumulate Merkle batch
        AS->>WA: seal integrity_anchor (merkle_root + chain)
        WA->>CH: mirror to integrity_anchors table
        WA-->>AS: anchor sealed
        AS->>AC: freshness updated (IngestFreshness)
    else schema unknown / strict mode / mapping failure
        AC->>DL: quarantine raw message
        DL->>CH: INSERT dead_letter_events<br/>(idempotent on content_hash)
        DL-->>AC: dead-letter counter bumped
    end

    note over CH: silver_current_state VIEW<br/>= argMax(aggregate_version) over bronze<br/>silver_history VIEW = SCD2 intervals<br/>gold_daily_event_volume VIEW = BI rollups
